{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "698623f0-079d-80e2-929d-84ed13aad1c5",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T12:27:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dennis Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:24:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:24:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah? My name is Dennis Dolan? I got a shutoff warning in the mail for my water and sewer bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:24:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. What's the service address, Mr. Dolan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:24:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 7 Kingston Avenue? Up on the Hill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:24:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, give me a second to pull that up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:24:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure? [pause] Sorry, I can hear you typing, by the way? So I know you're in there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:24:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, still here. Okay, I've got the account. There's a past due balance on it, and the notice you got is the final notice before a shutoff."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:25:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's what it says? But it doesn't really say how much time I have? Like, is it days, is it a couple weeks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:25:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The notice should have a date on it. Look near the top or in the box by the amount due. That's the date the balance needs to be paid by to avoid shutoff."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:25:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, hang on? [pause] Yeah, here it is? It says January ninth?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:25:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's your deadline, then. So you've got a little over a week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:25:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good? So, um, is a payment plan possible? I can't do the whole thing at once right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:25:43-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can be. Usually you'd pay part of it up front and then spread the rest out over a few months. I can't approve the terms from my desk, but I can note your account and have someone from the billing supervisor's side call you back. Is this number a good one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:26:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the one I'm on? It's 401-555-0163?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:26:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, 401-555-0163. I'll put that in the notes. They should reach out in a day or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:26:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks? And one more thing? If I can't get down there during the day, can I drop a payment in the box tonight? Would that count as on time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:26:22-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's a payment drop box outside City Hall, and it's available after hours. Put a check or money order in with your payment stub or your account number written on it. Anything in the box is generally processed the next business day, but it counts as received when you drop it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:26:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay? So if I put a check in tonight, I'm good for that amount, at least?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:26:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It'd be credited toward the balance, yes. Just keep in mind a partial payment doesn't automatically stop the shutoff, so you'll want that call back about the plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:26:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it? So drop the check tonight, and wait for the call about the plan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:27:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:27:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it? Thanks for your help, Tony?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:27:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Dolan. Take care."
    }
  ],
